  "details": "Animations that have gestures assigned to them have a bug that happens randomly on desktop users. Animations are activated randomly by turning disabled objects on without users actually activating them, this only happens to destop users and is visible to all other players except the player who is using the avatar, hence the player does not notice he is actually playing the animation.\n\nFor example an avatar with a guitar starts playing music randomly or avatars with guns fire them randomly.",
